1
00:06:25,714 --> 00:06:31,714
Quicksilver Highway is a horror, thriller, tv
movie film directed by Mick Garris.

2
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
Aaron Quicksilver is a mysterious storyteller whose listeners invariably
end up as the subjects of his gruesome, grisly tales.

3
00:19:17,142 --> 00:19:23,142
He tells a new bride stranded on a desert highway a horrifying account of a set of carnivorous toy teeth, then
entrains a pickpocket with the spine chilling story of an army of murderous, disembodied hands.

4
00:25:42,857 --> 00:25:48,857
Aaron Quicksilver, played by Christopher Lloyd.

5
00:32:08,571 --> 00:32:14,571
