10
01:04:17,142 --> 01:04:23,142
Quicksilver Highway is a 1997 made for television comedy
horror anthology film directed by Mick Garris.

11
01:10:42,857 --> 01:10:48,857
It is based on Clive Barker's 1985 short story "The Body Politic"
and Stephen King's 1992 short story "Chattery Teeth".

12
01:17:08,571 --> 01:17:14,571
The film was originally shown on the Fox Network on 13 May
1997, before being released on home media.

13
01:23:34,285 --> 01:23:40,285
The tone is dark and intense.
